  "description": "Love! Love! Fighting is about a young woman who currently has no money, no job and her father won’t return her phone calls. Stressed and in sore need of a good break, Oriana finds herself in a difficult position when her bossy little cousins tricks her back to their home country South Korea. Struggling with questions of worthiness and love, Oriana, our plus-sized heroine, is on a journey of self-discovery as she navigates the pressures of a South Korean variety show while confronting her past and finding the strength to embrace her true self-worth.",
